menu "FNK0099 probe"
    config FNK0099_HID_PROBE
        bool "Build the composite keyboard/mouse HID probe"
        default n
        depends on !FNK0099_MSC_PROBE
        help
            Inspect HID interfaces and report descriptors. Input capture is
            enabled only by an explicit UART command and expires after 30 seconds.

    config FNK0099_MSC_PROBE
        bool "Build the USB MSC probe instead of the SFC HID probe"
        default n
        help
            Select the dedicated USB card reader probe. File creation requires
            an explicit UART command. Existing files are not overwritten and
            automatic formatting is disabled.
endmenu
